abstract: >-
  An interactive map and data browser for Diospyros (Ebenaceae) samples in New
  Caledonia, with GPS coordinates, DNA, RNA and soil data, sequencing file paths
  and MD5 sums, genome assemblies with their reference samples, and species
  photos. Beta version: all data in this version are simulated.
